WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:13.700
Intents: groups of what a customer means (price, booking, shipping, complaint…) with their words; the assistant first works out a message's intent, then picks the right reply.

2
00:00:14.248 --> 00:00:17.400
Click an intent to see its words and reply.

3
00:00:17.952 --> 00:00:21.030
Add the words your customers actually write.

4
00:00:21.578 --> 00:00:26.330
Type a sentence in "Test a message" to see which intent it hits.

5
00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:31.940
Don't put one word in two intents; use the "Lexicon" for synonyms.
